///
/// One chain of triggers, identified by the correlation of the change that started it. The chain keeps the number of jobs it created. Every change carries its hop count, and the next change of the chain carries the count raised by one. The next change of the chain follows 100 ms after the one before (default). One model tick is 100 ms here (timeScale 100), so the model delay of one tick is the 100 ms.
